WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.583
<i>Who is this?</i>

2
00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:37.917
<i>His name is Suroso.</i>

3
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.625
<i>The Chief of Karang Setan Village.</i>

4
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:42.792
<i>What do you want to do with him?</i>

5
00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:45.750
<i>I want him to die quickly.</i>

6
00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:50.750
Why should he die?

7
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.167
So I can replace him and become

8
00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.917
the Chief of Karang Setan.

9
00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:01.417
Are you ready to bear the sins?

10
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:05.667
If I wasn't ready.

11
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.042
I wouldn't have come here to meet you.

12
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:29.125
Pardi.

13
00:01:32.042 --> 00:01:33.958
I took half to pay your debt.

14
00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.625
Daliman.

15
00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:40.125
Why are you lining up. huh?

16
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:43.125
Your wages are gone
from paying your the debt!

17
00:01:43.792 --> 00:01:46.625
Please. Mr. Banteng.
Please take half for now.

18
00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:48.375
I need the money.

19
00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:51.833
Thank you.

20
00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:06.792
Please don't.

21
00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:09.000
Let's teach him a lesson.

22
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.917
- Soak him.
- No!

23
00:02:16.042 --> 00:02:18.542
- Please.
- Keep going.

24
00:02:35.417 --> 00:02:37.417
Don't lie to me.

25
00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.292
I swear.

26
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:43.458
I have nothing left to pay my debt.

27
00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:49.208
Boss.

28
00:02:49.292 --> 00:02:51.333
I beg you. Boss.

29
00:02:52.292 --> 00:02:55.375
I shall accept Mr. Kawi's request.

30
00:02:55.458 --> 00:03:00.042
I'll let my daughter work here
to pay my debt.

31
00:03:00.125 --> 00:03:02.792
DANGDUT NIGHT CLUB

32
00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:06.500
I know. right?

33
00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.083
I came here. and her you are.

34
00:03:23.708 --> 00:03:25.042
I'm Lawu.

35
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.375
- Here.
- Dad…

36
00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:39.375
It's okay.

37
00:03:49.417 --> 00:03:51.167
Sir. please don't.

38
00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:53.625
Please. don't.

39
00:03:54.292 --> 00:03:56.917
Help! Help me!

40
00:03:58.042 --> 00:03:59.667
Please help!

41
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.667
- Sweetie?
- Dad!

42
00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.708
- Sweetheart!
<i>- Help!</i>

43
00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:07.375
- My daughter!
<i>- Help!</i>

44
00:04:07.458 --> 00:04:08.625
- Sweetheart!
<i>- Dad!</i>

45
00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:18.500
KARANG SETAN VILLAGE HEAD OFFICE

46
00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:29.208
It won't start?

47
00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:35.167
Yes.

48
00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.583
May I help you?

49
00:04:38.417 --> 00:04:39.708
Sure.

50
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:53.458
You rarely use it. do you?

51
00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:55.917
Very rarely.

52
00:04:57.042 --> 00:04:59.375
Usually my father drives it.

53
00:05:05.292 --> 00:05:06.583
Thank God.

54
00:05:08.292 --> 00:05:10.292
- Thank you. sir.
- You're welcome.

55
00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:13.375
Sorry to trouble you.

56
00:05:14.042 --> 00:05:15.167
Not a problem.

57
00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.371
It would be a problem
if I had to pry open the engine.

58
00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:23.542
Is the office open or closed.
why is it so quiet?

59
00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:25.583
It's open.

60
00:05:25.667 --> 00:05:27.583
But the Chief isn't there.

61
00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:29.458
He passed away two weeks ago.

62
00:05:29.542 --> 00:05:31.208
May he rest in peace.

63
00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:33.083
Thank you.

64
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.375
Peace be upon you.

65
00:05:35.458 --> 00:05:37.083
And upon you too.

66
00:05:53.208 --> 00:05:56.208
I want to find someone
who used to live here.

67
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.083
- Who is it?
- His name is Kasman Wironegoro.

68
00:06:00.167 --> 00:06:01.292
Kasman?

69
00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:04.042
Gun. do you know him?

70
00:06:04.125 --> 00:06:06.476
He lived here quite a long time ago.
I was still a little boy.

71
00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.375
Listen. We'll help you
search for him in the district.

72
00:06:09.458 --> 00:06:11.250
Just come again later.

73
00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:14.125
Sorry. What's your name?

74
00:06:14.208 --> 00:06:15.208
I'm Pramuja.

75
00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.375
Oh. you can fill this form.

76
00:06:27.167 --> 00:06:28.458
<i>Sorry to trouble you.</i>

77
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:30.458
Not a problem.

78
00:06:30.542 --> 00:06:32.662
It would be a problem
if I had to pry open the engine.

79
00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.125
- Suzzanna?
- Yes?

80
00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:47.708
- Yes?
- Who is it from?

81
00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:51.042
From Bisman?

82
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:52.875
Mom?

83
00:06:53.292 --> 00:06:54.292
Hey.

84
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.083
Mom!

85
00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.833
Why did you accept it?

86
00:07:00.542 --> 00:07:05.417
It doesn't feel right
if we keep refusing Bisman's gift.

87
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.083
That's what he wants.

88
00:07:08.792 --> 00:07:12.250
He waits until we feel uncomfortable.
After a while.

89
00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:14.458
we'll end up accepting his proposal.

90
00:07:14.542 --> 00:07:19.375
Don't you feel sorry for our daughter?
She's becoming an old virgin.

91
00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:23.458
I also want Suzzanna
to get a husband soon.

92
00:07:23.542 --> 00:07:26.542
But not with a man who already has a wife.

93
00:07:26.625 --> 00:07:28.708
Especially that man named Bisman.

94
00:07:28.792 --> 00:07:30.083
Gosh. honey.

95
00:07:30.167 --> 00:07:33.542
Suzzanna will not be miserable.

96
00:07:33.625 --> 00:07:35.750
Even if she becomes a second wife.

97
00:07:35.833 --> 00:07:39.875
Because Bisman's wealth
will never run out.

98
00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:42.375
Oh. dear God.

99
00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:44.958
Do you know how he got that wealth?

100
00:07:45.792 --> 00:07:47.458
In what way?

101
00:07:47.542 --> 00:07:50.708
We don't need to worry about
other people's lives.

102
00:07:51.292 --> 00:07:54.958
What's important is that we're nice.
and our daughter is safe.

103
00:07:55.458 --> 00:07:58.083
Oh. so that's what you think?

104
00:07:58.167 --> 00:08:02.542
Sweetie. do you want to
accept Bisman's proposal?

105
00:08:05.542 --> 00:08:06.708
No. Dad.

106
00:08:06.792 --> 00:08:08.083
Why not?

107
00:08:08.958 --> 00:08:10.833
Your mother said.

108
00:08:10.917 --> 00:08:13.917
Bisman's wealth
will never run out for generations.

109
00:08:14.583 --> 00:08:17.500
It's not that I don't want
to get married soon. Mom.

110
00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:20.750
But I want to find a good husband.

111
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:22.833
That's right.

112
00:08:22.917 --> 00:08:27.375
A good husband… When will you find one?

113
00:08:27.458 --> 00:08:29.750
We'll meet soon.

114
00:08:31.083 --> 00:08:34.667
I can feel it. My soulmate is near.

115
00:08:35.542 --> 00:08:37.208
Such a know-it-all.

116
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:46.458
What is going on?

117
00:08:47.042 --> 00:08:49.208
The situation is getting worse. Teacher.

118
00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:52.958
Come in. come in.

119
00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:02.250
I'm sorry.

120
00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:04.333
I invited my friends here

121
00:09:04.417 --> 00:09:07.625
hoping that you can find a way out.

122
00:09:11.667 --> 00:09:14.792
You all know that I am a nobody.

123
00:09:15.917 --> 00:09:17.583
I'm just a teacher.

124
00:09:17.667 --> 00:09:21.500
But in my opinion.
Mr. Satrio is more than just a teacher.

125
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.500
Because only you have the courage
to go against Bisman's men.

126
00:09:27.583 --> 00:09:30.667
If that time you did not appear.

127
00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.458
<i>I would have been dead.</i>

128
00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:40.375
Teacher. Do you have a death wish?

129
00:09:40.458 --> 00:09:42.500
You guys have a death wish

130
00:09:42.583 --> 00:09:45.000
if you still insist on disturbing
the sellers here.

131
00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:47.958
You bastard.

132
00:09:49.083 --> 00:09:50.083
Look.

133
00:09:51.208 --> 00:09:53.917
Everyone. look.
There are only four of them.

134
00:09:54.958 --> 00:09:57.042
There is no reason to be afraid.

135
00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.750
<i>Anyone can do the same thing I did</i>

136
00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:21.458
when faced with a situation like that.

137
00:10:21.542 --> 00:10:24.000
But most people just run away. sir.

138
00:10:24.083 --> 00:10:25.667
Mr. Satrio.

139
00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.000
now is not the time to be humble.

140
00:10:28.083 --> 00:10:31.292
The residents here
want you to lead the resistance

141
00:10:31.375 --> 00:10:33.625
against Bisman.

142
00:10:33.708 --> 00:10:35.167
Not by violence.

143
00:10:36.083 --> 00:10:39.625
but in ways that do not break the law.

144
00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:41.000
What do you mean?

145
00:10:41.083 --> 00:10:45.333
You must run for office.
in the village head elections next month.

146
00:10:45.417 --> 00:10:47.958
replacing the late Chief Suroso.

147
00:10:48.875 --> 00:10:50.167
Because if not.

148
00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.250
Bisman will become the sole candidate.

149
00:10:54.208 --> 00:10:55.792
And that's exactly what he wants.

150
00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:11.083
Listen. you can't act like a hero. Dad.

151
00:11:11.667 --> 00:11:13.375
I am not.

152
00:11:14.375 --> 00:11:17.167
These days. everyone
should want to be a hero.

153
00:11:20.083 --> 00:11:23.625
The behavior of Bisman
and his men is truly barbaric.

154
00:11:23.708 --> 00:11:26.792
And no one should let it happen.
Including me.

155
00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:30.750
But people expect you to step
forward to lead the resistance.

156
00:11:31.792 --> 00:11:33.292
I'm thinking about it.

157
00:11:34.792 --> 00:11:37.750
Dad. just mind your own business.

158
00:11:38.875 --> 00:11:41.958
If needed. we should just move
to another village.

159
00:11:42.042 --> 00:11:43.333
Sweetheart.

160
00:11:43.917 --> 00:11:47.958
We must fight injustice.

161
00:11:48.042 --> 00:11:53.375
Imagine. what if it happened to our
family? Aren't you going to ask for help?

162
00:11:53.958 --> 00:11:56.542
Does it have to be you
who steps forward to lead?

163
00:11:56.625 --> 00:11:59.542
Whoever becomes the leader.

164
00:11:59.625 --> 00:12:05.583
everyone must be ready to accept the fact
that every change will demand sacrifice.

165
00:12:06.375 --> 00:12:07.417
Do you understand?

166
00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.833
You're right.

167
00:12:10.917 --> 00:12:14.750
But don't hurt your own family.

168
00:12:14.833 --> 00:12:15.958
I will never.

169
00:12:16.625 --> 00:12:19.250
Not directly.

170
00:12:19.875 --> 00:12:22.625
But because of your actions.
Bisman might get angry.

171
00:12:22.708 --> 00:12:26.250
He'll make our family miserable.
What is the difference?

172
00:12:26.333 --> 00:12:27.500
Whatever.

173
00:12:33.667 --> 00:12:38.000
Are you sure Satrio dares
to lead people against me?

174
00:12:38.083 --> 00:12:42.625
From what I heard. their conversation
was heading in that direction. Boss.

175
00:12:42.708 --> 00:12:45.375
What's so great about him?
Is he really a hero?

176
00:12:45.458 --> 00:12:47.542
Maybe because
he had the guts to fight back.

177
00:12:48.292 --> 00:12:49.292
Against who?

178
00:12:49.375 --> 00:12:52.417
- Me and the guys.
- He defeated you guys?

179
00:12:53.083 --> 00:12:56.458
That time it didn't turn into a fight.
but he has the influence.

180
00:12:56.542 --> 00:12:58.958
Making people angry and willing to fight.

181
00:12:59.042 --> 00:13:01.667
That bastard is the source of the problem.

182
00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.542
Of all the villagers of Karang Setan.

183
00:13:03.625 --> 00:13:06.333
he's the only one
who didn't want to sell his land to us.

184
00:13:06.417 --> 00:13:08.458
There's one more thing. Boss.

185
00:13:08.542 --> 00:13:11.708
Something Satrio is planning

186
00:13:11.792 --> 00:13:14.042
that I believe is extremely dangerous.

187
00:13:14.125 --> 00:13:17.833
Preventing Bisman
from becoming chief is necessary.

188
00:13:17.917 --> 00:13:22.042
But if he has already committed acts
of oppression against you

189
00:13:22.583 --> 00:13:26.625
and ordered his men
to carry out violence against you.

190
00:13:26.708 --> 00:13:31.083
why is it that until now no one
has ever reported this to the police?

191
00:13:31.167 --> 00:13:34.167
We've done that before.

192
00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.208
But it was ignored.

193
00:13:36.292 --> 00:13:40.000
Could it be because the ones who came
were small people like me?

194
00:13:40.083 --> 00:13:43.792
If that's the case.
then we should ask you for help as well.

195
00:13:44.542 --> 00:13:46.875
Please go to the city
and file a report with the police.

196
00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.000
<i>He's confident</i>

197
00:13:49.583 --> 00:13:53.292
that the police will
shut this place down permanently.

198
00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.125
A night of terror.

199
00:14:45.042 --> 00:14:47.000
Curses come from all directions.

200
00:14:47.083 --> 00:14:51.000
Tormented souls. full of suspicion.

201
00:14:51.083 --> 00:14:55.417
A body consumed by dark forest spirits.

202
00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.292
Come from the north.
south. west. and east.

203
00:14:59.375 --> 00:15:04.292
<i>Come to me on this darkest night.</i>

204
00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:08.125
<i>I am your servant. I am your offering.</i>

205
00:15:08.667 --> 00:15:12.375
<i>I give you my blood and my life.</i>

206
00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.667
Drink.

207
00:15:44.042 --> 00:15:47.667
I planted it
at the back door of his house.

208
00:15:49.625 --> 00:15:51.125
It is called

209
00:15:51.875 --> 00:15:54.625
the death-strike curse.

210
00:16:13.542 --> 00:16:15.583
Mom. what's wrong?

211
00:16:18.958 --> 00:16:21.250
Mom. Kitty is dead!

212
00:16:22.958 --> 00:16:24.125
Kitty?

213
00:16:24.208 --> 00:16:27.250
Hot! Hot! Oh. it's hot!

214
00:16:29.042 --> 00:16:30.708
Hot!

215
00:16:30.792 --> 00:16:33.833
- It's hot!
- What's wrong?

216
00:16:33.917 --> 00:16:35.458
Hot!

217
00:16:35.542 --> 00:16:37.583
What happened to you?

218
00:16:37.667 --> 00:16:39.208
Ouch. it's hot. ouch!

219
00:16:39.292 --> 00:16:41.500
Hot. hot!

220
00:16:41.583 --> 00:16:44.167
- It's hot!
- What is happening?

221
00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.875
Hot. hot!

222
00:16:45.958 --> 00:16:47.750
Honey. what's wrong?

223
00:16:48.958 --> 00:16:50.167
Dad?

224
00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.208
Hot. it hurts. hot!

225
00:16:53.292 --> 00:16:54.625
- It hurts.
- Dad!

226
00:16:54.708 --> 00:16:58.333
Stay away. dear. this must be witchcraft.

227
00:16:58.417 --> 00:17:01.417
- Witchcraft?
- Hot! It's hot.

228
00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.792
Wait…

229
00:17:03.542 --> 00:17:05.500
- What is this?
- Father!

230
00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.375
Ouch. it hurts!

231
00:17:12.458 --> 00:17:15.042
It hurts. what's happening to me?

232
00:17:15.125 --> 00:17:16.333
- Dad…
- Help me!

233
00:17:16.417 --> 00:17:18.958
Ouch. it hurts!

234
00:17:21.917 --> 00:17:23.167
Ouch. ouch!

235
00:17:26.125 --> 00:17:27.125
Ouch. ouch!

236
00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.417
- Ouch!
- Dad!

237
00:17:34.583 --> 00:17:37.583
- Dad!
- Honey!

238
00:17:37.667 --> 00:17:39.625
- Honey!
- Dad!

239
00:17:39.708 --> 00:17:40.875
- Honey?
- Dad?

240
00:17:40.958 --> 00:17:42.708
- Honey?
- Dad?

241
00:17:43.708 --> 00:17:46.625
- Dad!
- Honey…

242
00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.500
Honey…

243
00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Long live Chief Bisman!

244
00:17:55.083 --> 00:17:57.292
Long live!

245
00:18:04.333 --> 00:18:06.083
DANGDUT NIGHT CLUB

246
00:18:25.125 --> 00:18:27.042
Boss. wait! Calm down.

247
00:18:34.208 --> 00:18:35.208
Boss.

248
00:18:39.375 --> 00:18:40.375
Here you go. Boss.

249
00:18:41.042 --> 00:18:45.625
I had to look for it in your room.
I couldn't find it at the front desk.

250
00:18:45.708 --> 00:18:47.792
Why didn't you ask my wife?

251
00:18:48.375 --> 00:18:49.792
Mrs. Suroh is not here.

252
00:18:51.625 --> 00:18:56.500
<i>The maid said. she just left
for the prayers at Suzzanna's house.</i>

253
00:18:57.083 --> 00:18:58.083
What?

254
00:18:58.792 --> 00:19:01.292
Go after her. Stop her.

255
00:19:01.375 --> 00:19:04.167
- Don't let her meet Suzzanna.
- Yes.

256
00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:07.250
She's going to babble
all sorts of things about Satrio's death.

257
00:19:07.833 --> 00:19:08.667
Yes. Boss.

258
00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:09.750
Don't go alone.

259
00:19:09.792 --> 00:19:11.792
<i>It must be crowded there.</i>

260
00:19:11.875 --> 00:19:15.625
<i>If you meet people who don't like us.
it'll be a hassle.</i>

261
00:19:15.708 --> 00:19:18.250
<i>- Take Banteng and Lawu with you.
- Yes. Boss.</i>

262
00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.250
<i>Where is your mother?</i>

263
00:19:22.917 --> 00:19:26.417
She went to the mosque.
Delivering food to the orphans.

264
00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:30.417
Alright then. I'll just speak with you.

265
00:19:31.042 --> 00:19:32.625
So that my heart can be at peace.

266
00:19:32.708 --> 00:19:37.458
Because even in the afterlife.
I would feel haunted by guilt

267
00:19:38.125 --> 00:19:42.750
if I helped keep secret
the injustice that you deserve to know.

268
00:19:43.458 --> 00:19:44.792
What injustice. Ma'am?

269
00:19:44.875 --> 00:19:46.958
The cause of your father's death.

270
00:19:56.125 --> 00:20:00.042
Back then.
he sent a dark spell to Chief Suroso.

271
00:20:00.125 --> 00:20:02.167
Until he got sick and died.

272
00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.708
Oh. dear God.

273
00:20:04.792 --> 00:20:06.000
After that.

274
00:20:06.667 --> 00:20:09.042
the people held an election.

275
00:20:09.125 --> 00:20:13.583
And he had to go up against your father
who was liked by many people.

276
00:20:13.667 --> 00:20:19.125
Your father's fate. my dear.
was not much different from Suroso.

277
00:20:20.083 --> 00:20:22.583
Killed by witchcraft.

278
00:20:24.542 --> 00:20:25.625
Oh. God.

279
00:20:36.583 --> 00:20:38.708
- Mrs. Suroh.
- What do you want?

280
00:20:39.375 --> 00:20:41.958
Sorry. ma'am. Boss is looking for you.

281
00:20:42.625 --> 00:20:46.292
Earlier. he told us
to look for you and bring you home.

282
00:20:46.375 --> 00:20:48.208
Tell your boss. okay?

283
00:20:48.792 --> 00:20:50.583
I'm staying here.

284
00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:54.875
Well. if you want to stay here. please do.

285
00:20:54.958 --> 00:20:58.417
But we will also stay here
and wait for you.

286
00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:01.042
No need! You should go!

287
00:21:03.583 --> 00:21:04.583
Banteng!

288
00:21:05.375 --> 00:21:09.042
No need to make it difficult.
We're just carrying out orders.

289
00:21:09.125 --> 00:21:10.167
Let's go home.

290
00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.792
- Come!
- What the heck?

291
00:21:12.875 --> 00:21:15.083
- Come home!
- How dare you!

292
00:21:18.125 --> 00:21:22.250
You're so rude!
How dare you touch someone else's wife?

293
00:21:22.333 --> 00:21:24.417
Why are you so angry?

294
00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.917
No wonder Boss wants to get married again.

295
00:21:32.875 --> 00:21:34.167
Banteng!

296
00:21:36.042 --> 00:21:37.250
How dare you!

297
00:21:40.292 --> 00:21:42.500
- Where do you think you're going?
- Let me go!

298
00:21:45.208 --> 00:21:46.458
Idiot!

299
00:21:48.167 --> 00:21:49.792
Mrs. Suroh…

300
00:21:58.417 --> 00:21:59.667
You.

301
00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:02.583
If you ever tell our boss. you're dead!

302
00:22:29.917 --> 00:22:30.917
Come on. come on!

303
00:23:57.500 --> 00:24:00.833
Where are you going now?

304
00:24:04.833 --> 00:24:05.833
Go on. jump!

305
00:24:15.125 --> 00:24:16.250
Jump!

306
00:25:25.542 --> 00:25:26.542
Boss.

307
00:25:27.500 --> 00:25:29.708
I am ready to accept the punishment.

308
00:25:30.500 --> 00:25:31.750
Even if you'll kill me.

309
00:25:32.375 --> 00:25:34.042
I am willing…

310
00:25:41.792 --> 00:25:43.333
What about Suzzanna?

311
00:25:48.500 --> 00:25:51.208
- Suzzanna…
- After seeing Mrs. Suroh's condition.

312
00:25:51.292 --> 00:25:53.958
Suzzanna got scared
and ran out of the house.

313
00:25:54.042 --> 00:25:55.375
We tried to catch up.

314
00:25:55.958 --> 00:25:57.125
but we lost her.

315
00:25:57.917 --> 00:25:58.958
We tried to find her.

316
00:26:00.625 --> 00:26:05.208
But we decided
to return to Suzzanna's house.

317
00:26:05.292 --> 00:26:07.500
To take care of Mrs. Suroh's body.

318
00:26:07.583 --> 00:26:09.958
Does she know
that I put a spell on her father?

319
00:26:10.042 --> 00:26:13.667
It seems like…
Mrs. Suroh hadn't told her yet. Boss.

320
00:26:15.292 --> 00:26:16.500
Find Suzzanna.

321
00:26:17.125 --> 00:26:19.125
As soon as you do. report to me.

322
00:26:20.375 --> 00:26:23.083
Don't let anything happen to Suzzanna.

323
00:26:23.792 --> 00:26:24.792
Yes. Boss.

324
00:27:35.958 --> 00:27:37.333
Bruised and battered.

325
00:27:40.208 --> 00:27:43.500
It's cracked. There is a deep wound here.

326
00:27:45.125 --> 00:27:46.750
She got stabbed too.

327
00:27:46.833 --> 00:27:48.833
But she's not dead yet.

328
00:27:55.208 --> 00:27:56.208
Pramuja.

329
00:27:57.750 --> 00:28:01.958
Stay until she gets better. okay?
Poor thing.

330
00:28:03.792 --> 00:28:06.458
I can heal her internal wounds.

331
00:28:07.917 --> 00:28:09.667
You heal the outside wounds.

332
00:28:12.083 --> 00:28:13.250
Yes. Auntie.

333
00:29:45.167 --> 00:29:48.000
Her will to live is strong.

334
00:29:49.250 --> 00:29:50.417
Pramuja?

335
00:30:02.583 --> 00:30:04.042
What you said is true.

336
00:30:05.708 --> 00:30:07.268
It took three weeks for her to wake up.

337
00:30:12.292 --> 00:30:14.083
Don't get up yet.

338
00:30:15.125 --> 00:30:17.417
Your bones are not strong enough.

339
00:30:17.500 --> 00:30:18.542
Rest.

340
00:30:24.958 --> 00:30:26.333
Where am I?

341
00:30:26.417 --> 00:30:28.000
In my house.

342
00:30:28.708 --> 00:30:30.625
Kalinegoro Village.

343
00:30:32.042 --> 00:30:34.333
This is my nephew. Pramuja.

344
00:30:35.417 --> 00:30:38.000
It was my nephew who helped you.

345
00:30:43.875 --> 00:30:46.042
What's your name. dear?

346
00:30:46.125 --> 00:30:47.667
Suzzanna.

347
00:30:48.375 --> 00:30:49.875
Suzzanna.

348
00:30:51.250 --> 00:30:53.250
My name is Gayatri.

349
00:30:53.333 --> 00:30:55.167
And I'm Bawuk.

350
00:31:29.458 --> 00:31:30.500
Take it easy.

351
00:31:46.167 --> 00:31:47.458
Are your legs strong enough?

352
00:31:48.583 --> 00:31:50.583
Thanks to you and your aunt.

353
00:31:52.375 --> 00:31:54.375
- Can I help you?
- No need.

354
00:31:55.792 --> 00:31:58.417
I'll manage. Have a seat.

355
00:32:06.833 --> 00:32:09.833
Maybe you don't remember
but we have met before.

356
00:32:20.208 --> 00:32:21.375
Let me help you.

357
00:32:32.375 --> 00:32:33.458
I remember.

358
00:32:46.708 --> 00:32:48.792
Her hand still hurts. Auntie.

359
00:32:49.500 --> 00:32:50.750
I'm helping her.

360
00:32:51.375 --> 00:32:53.542
Yes. go ahead and help her.

361
00:33:04.458 --> 00:33:07.750
TWO WEEKS LATER

362
00:33:17.125 --> 00:33:19.083
- I'm getting the clothes.
- I'll do it.

363
00:33:32.958 --> 00:33:33.958
A moment.

364
00:33:35.708 --> 00:33:38.875
He has hurt me for decades. Ma'am.

365
00:33:40.125 --> 00:33:42.000
I can't take it anymore.

366
00:33:44.167 --> 00:33:48.292
He even started beating up my kids.

367
00:33:50.333 --> 00:33:53.125
I can't let this go on any longer.

368
00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:56.167
How can I help you?

369
00:33:56.833 --> 00:33:58.458
Please send my husband home. Ma'am.

370
00:33:59.292 --> 00:34:00.458
Send him home?

371
00:34:01.042 --> 00:34:02.750
What do you mean?

372
00:34:03.417 --> 00:34:05.000
Return him to God.

373
00:35:05.167 --> 00:35:06.333
Pramuja.

374
00:35:10.125 --> 00:35:12.833
- What is this. Auntie?
- I already told you.

375
00:35:12.917 --> 00:35:14.917
Never come in here.

376
00:35:16.583 --> 00:35:18.958
All this time I thought
that you only practiced healing.

377
00:35:19.042 --> 00:35:21.125
But this. this is all…

378
00:35:27.958 --> 00:35:29.750
- Are you disappointed?
- I…

379
00:35:31.417 --> 00:35:33.500
Then you'd better go.

380
00:35:34.292 --> 00:35:37.083
- And don't stay here anymore.
- But…

381
00:36:30.375 --> 00:36:33.458
Please forgive my mistake
and impudence. Ma'am.

382
00:36:33.542 --> 00:36:35.833
But she forced her way in.

383
00:36:35.917 --> 00:36:37.500
What do you want?

384
00:36:46.125 --> 00:36:48.750
Let me learn from you. Ma'am.

385
00:36:50.458 --> 00:36:54.583
So that I can get revenge
on the cruel people who did this to me.

386
00:36:55.708 --> 00:36:56.708
My dear.

387
00:36:58.208 --> 00:37:01.542
Aren't you afraid of God?

388
00:37:01.625 --> 00:37:03.375
Why do you ask that?

389
00:37:06.292 --> 00:37:07.458
Oh. dear.

390
00:37:07.542 --> 00:37:10.292
I know what you want.

391
00:37:11.083 --> 00:37:15.292
I also know that. once you start learning.

392
00:37:15.375 --> 00:37:17.958
you have to be ready

393
00:37:18.042 --> 00:37:20.958
to go to the depths of hell.

394
00:37:22.708 --> 00:37:24.042
For me.

395
00:37:24.958 --> 00:37:28.333
the fire of hell
is in Karang Setan. Ma'am.

396
00:37:32.542 --> 00:37:33.708
And I…

397
00:37:35.250 --> 00:37:38.333
Will try with
the strength that I have left

398
00:37:38.417 --> 00:37:42.750
to put it out. Ma'am.
Even if I get burned in the process.

399
00:37:45.375 --> 00:37:47.667
Do you really want it that desperately?

400
00:37:48.417 --> 00:37:51.708
I don't know where else
to ask for help. Ma'am.

401
00:37:55.125 --> 00:37:57.208
I have to save my mom.

402
00:37:59.208 --> 00:38:00.208
Come then. dear.

403
00:38:10.917 --> 00:38:14.667
For a long time.
I've been looking for someone

404
00:38:14.750 --> 00:38:17.125
who I consider worthy
to inherit my knowledge.

405
00:38:18.208 --> 00:38:20.333
I thought Pramuja would do it.

406
00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:25.750
But it turned out he only wanted
to study healing.

407
00:38:26.708 --> 00:38:28.500
For him. things like this

408
00:38:29.083 --> 00:38:30.833
are polytheism.

409
00:38:34.250 --> 00:38:36.625
And then you came.

410
00:38:38.958 --> 00:38:41.875
My inner eye can immediately see

411
00:38:41.958 --> 00:38:43.958
that you have the ability

412
00:38:44.042 --> 00:38:47.375
which will make it easier for you
to absorb the knowledge I have.

413
00:38:48.042 --> 00:38:49.417
What abilities. Ma'am?

414
00:38:54.542 --> 00:38:56.042
Do you see Bawuk?

415
00:38:58.375 --> 00:38:59.292
Yes.

416
00:38:59.375 --> 00:39:03.750
Have you ever seen
Pramuja talking to Bawuk?

417
00:39:07.375 --> 00:39:09.917
Pramuja can't see Bawuk.

418
00:39:10.667 --> 00:39:12.083
But you can.

419
00:39:12.167 --> 00:39:15.333
Bawuk is actually a <i>Jinn</i>

420
00:39:15.417 --> 00:39:18.750
who lives in this house.

421
00:39:20.417 --> 00:39:24.208
You were unconscious for almost a month.

422
00:39:24.292 --> 00:39:26.750
It seems to have honed your skills.

423
00:39:28.375 --> 00:39:29.958
And with this ability.

424
00:39:30.042 --> 00:39:31.625
I'm sure. my dear.

425
00:39:32.833 --> 00:39:37.042
that you will easily learn
the knowledge that I possess.

426
00:39:37.833 --> 00:39:39.000
First of all.

427
00:39:39.083 --> 00:39:42.333
<i>you have to undergo white fasting.</i>

428
00:39:42.958 --> 00:39:45.958
<i>For seven days and seven nights.</i>

429
00:39:46.042 --> 00:39:50.375
<i>And during that time.
you have to stay standing.</i>

430
00:39:50.458 --> 00:39:52.750
<i>You must not sleep.</i>

431
00:39:53.458 --> 00:39:58.875
<i>After fasting. you have to soak in water
on the coast of the South Sea</i>

432
00:39:58.958 --> 00:40:02.167
<i>while continuously praying.</i>

433
00:40:02.250 --> 00:40:06.333
<i>So that you are ready to receive
the knowledge you desire.</i>

434
00:40:06.417 --> 00:40:11.500
<i>And what requires the most strength
and endurance of your body and soul is</i>

435
00:40:11.583 --> 00:40:14.750
<i>meditating for 40 days</i>

436
00:40:14.833 --> 00:40:16.917
<i>and 40 nights.</i>

437
00:41:01.292 --> 00:41:03.125
<i>At one point.</i>

438
00:41:04.125 --> 00:41:08.458
<i>you will find a spirit familiar
who is compatible with you.</i>

439
00:41:10.333 --> 00:41:13.250
<i>Who will always be ready to help you.</i>

440
00:41:14.708 --> 00:41:18.250
<i>And carry out all
your orders and requests.</i>

441
00:41:18.333 --> 00:41:19.750
<i>As long as</i>

442
00:41:20.625 --> 00:41:24.417
<i>you give her offerings
according to her wishes.</i>

443
00:41:26.750 --> 00:41:31.833
<i>Keep your heirloom and take it with you.
wherever you go.</i>

444
00:41:31.917 --> 00:41:33.625
<i>Because that's where</i>

445
00:41:34.292 --> 00:41:39.750
<i>your familiar spirit will stay
until you need its help.</i>

446
00:41:45.417 --> 00:41:46.417
Good afternoon. Chief.

447
00:41:47.583 --> 00:41:48.583
Good afternoon.

448
00:41:54.375 --> 00:41:55.708
How can I help?

449
00:41:56.750 --> 00:42:00.042
Listen. Chief. the reason why I came here

450
00:42:00.125 --> 00:42:03.417
is to find out about someone
who once lived here.

451
00:42:03.500 --> 00:42:07.042
His name is Kasman Wironegoro.

452
00:42:08.875 --> 00:42:12.250
You're looking for someone named Kasman?
What's the reason?

453
00:42:14.250 --> 00:42:15.875
He is my father.

454
00:42:19.500 --> 00:42:22.625
I don't have any pictures.
but I have a picture of my mother.

455
00:42:26.208 --> 00:42:28.125
Your father was a savage.

456
00:42:29.042 --> 00:42:32.583
He once got a woman pregnant
and then got kicked out of this village.

457
00:42:40.792 --> 00:42:44.125
I'm sorry. Chief.
But do you know where my father is?

458
00:42:44.208 --> 00:42:46.500
Or at least where he lives?

459
00:42:46.583 --> 00:42:48.167
Your father is dead.

460
00:42:55.458 --> 00:42:57.625
- Is this coffee or horse piss?
- Coffee. Boss.

461
00:42:57.708 --> 00:42:59.083
Don't talk back to me!

462
00:43:10.167 --> 00:43:11.417
I should go.

463
00:43:21.167 --> 00:43:23.167
Who made coffee for the chief?

464
00:43:23.750 --> 00:43:24.750
I did.

465
00:43:25.917 --> 00:43:27.583
Was that coffee or horse piss?

466
00:43:29.417 --> 00:43:30.542
Coffee. obviously.

467
00:43:30.625 --> 00:43:31.833
Make a better one.

468
00:43:31.917 --> 00:43:33.125
The Chief left already.

469
00:43:33.208 --> 00:43:35.875
Just make some more.
For me. Tohir. and Diran.

470
00:43:36.792 --> 00:43:38.000
Gosh.

471
00:43:43.375 --> 00:43:44.375
Geez.

472
00:43:44.833 --> 00:43:47.792
When morons get promoted as officials.
they get so cocky.

473
00:43:48.667 --> 00:43:50.208
Idiots.

474
00:44:05.958 --> 00:44:07.917
What are you using that for?

475
00:44:08.000 --> 00:44:09.292
Herbal drink.

476
00:44:29.875 --> 00:44:31.833
Here. I've made more coffee.

477
00:44:44.583 --> 00:44:46.125
What did you add to this coffee?

478
00:44:48.000 --> 00:44:49.875
Well. I had some nutmeg powder.

479
00:44:49.958 --> 00:44:51.625
I tried mixing it in.

480
00:44:53.750 --> 00:44:56.542
Now. this is coffee!

481
00:44:59.750 --> 00:45:00.750
Try some. Tohir.

482
00:45:09.125 --> 00:45:10.750
Extraordinary!

483
00:45:13.083 --> 00:45:14.375
Give it a try. Diran.

484
00:45:20.583 --> 00:45:21.944
Why does it taste like horse piss?

485
00:45:24.208 --> 00:45:26.167
You don't understand coffee.

486
00:45:26.250 --> 00:45:27.500
Give it to me.

487
00:45:27.583 --> 00:45:31.125
Make me a cup again tomorrow. okay?

488
00:45:31.208 --> 00:45:32.250
Yes. sir.

489
00:45:39.083 --> 00:45:42.000
WELCOME TO KARANG SETAN VILLAGE

490
00:45:48.833 --> 00:45:49.958
Mom?

491
00:46:10.458 --> 00:46:11.458
Mom?

492
00:46:18.917 --> 00:46:19.917
Mom?

493
00:46:21.667 --> 00:46:22.667
Mom.

494
00:46:28.458 --> 00:46:29.500
Mom?

495
00:46:33.708 --> 00:46:35.458
Mom. you're burning up.

496
00:46:35.542 --> 00:46:37.750
It's been a long time. sweetie.

497
00:46:38.583 --> 00:46:40.250
Sometimes I get a fever.

498
00:46:41.500 --> 00:46:42.958
sometimes it goes away.

499
00:46:43.833 --> 00:46:45.583
What happened to your face?

500
00:46:46.333 --> 00:46:48.125
After you

501
00:46:49.417 --> 00:46:51.250
went missing…

502
00:46:53.417 --> 00:46:57.000
<i>The three thugs. Bisman's men</i>

503
00:46:57.083 --> 00:47:00.667
<i>come almost every day.</i>

504
00:47:00.750 --> 00:47:05.042
<i>I even memorized their names.</i>

505
00:47:05.125 --> 00:47:09.500
<i>Banteng. Lawu. Kawi.</i>

506
00:47:09.583 --> 00:47:13.208
<i>They come in
the morning asking for breakfast.</i>

507
00:47:13.292 --> 00:47:17.833
<i>They come in the afternoon. and at night</i>

508
00:47:17.917 --> 00:47:22.333
<i>while they got drunk.</i>

509
00:47:23.333 --> 00:47:28.375
<i>If they don't like my cooking.</i>

510
00:47:28.458 --> 00:47:30.042
<i>they get angry.</i>

511
00:47:40.292 --> 00:47:42.208
Those savages.

512
00:47:46.458 --> 00:47:49.292
They must be punished
as severely as possible.

513
00:47:49.958 --> 00:47:53.042
We're no match

514
00:47:54.667 --> 00:47:59.208
for their power.

515
00:48:01.750 --> 00:48:03.042
My dear…

516
00:48:04.625 --> 00:48:08.542
You should leave this village.

517
00:48:09.250 --> 00:48:10.292
Sweetie.

518
00:48:12.125 --> 00:48:15.125
I can't take it anymore.

519
00:48:15.750 --> 00:48:17.792
Remember. sweetie.

520
00:48:17.875 --> 00:48:21.500
Please bury me

521
00:48:22.250 --> 00:48:25.708
beside your father.

522
00:48:36.083 --> 00:48:37.083
Mom…

523
00:48:38.250 --> 00:48:39.125
SUTINI DAUGHTER OF PRAYITNO

524
00:48:39.208 --> 00:48:40.875
I'm sorry for your loss.

525
00:49:03.500 --> 00:49:04.500
Suzzanna?

526
00:49:09.792 --> 00:49:11.583
Why are you here?

527
00:49:11.667 --> 00:49:13.083
I…

528
00:49:13.875 --> 00:49:17.083
I'm looking for my father's gravestone.

529
00:49:17.167 --> 00:49:21.042
I've heard that there is a possibility
that my father has died.

530
00:49:23.208 --> 00:49:24.917
My mother passed away.

531
00:49:25.500 --> 00:49:27.875
Indeed. to Allah we belong
and to Him we shall return.

532
00:49:27.958 --> 00:49:30.667
Suzzanna. I'm sorry for your loss.

533
00:49:32.125 --> 00:49:33.167
Thank you.

534
00:49:34.250 --> 00:49:35.333
If you…

535
00:49:37.708 --> 00:49:39.500
Ever need my help.

536
00:49:40.208 --> 00:49:42.042
you can meet me at the mosque.

537
00:49:43.042 --> 00:49:44.250
It's nearby.

538
00:49:44.792 --> 00:49:46.417
I'm staying there for now.

539
00:49:47.458 --> 00:49:48.833
Thank you. Pramuja.

540
00:50:00.333 --> 00:50:01.333
Hang in there.

541
00:50:21.583 --> 00:50:22.625
Suzzanna.

542
00:50:23.292 --> 00:50:26.583
It's so unfortunate that we keep meeting
in sad situations like this.

543
00:50:26.667 --> 00:50:29.792
The people of
the Karang Setan village administration.

544
00:50:30.417 --> 00:50:34.667
offer our deepest condolences
on the passing of Mrs. Sutini.

545
00:50:37.208 --> 00:50:38.917
Thank you. Boss.

546
00:50:39.000 --> 00:50:40.917
Please don't call me that.

547
00:50:42.042 --> 00:50:44.458
You can call me Chief. Or Bisman.

548
00:50:45.875 --> 00:50:48.667
Thank you. Bisman.

549
00:50:49.708 --> 00:50:51.417
Where have you been. Suzzanna?

550
00:50:52.375 --> 00:50:53.875
Since your father passed away.

551
00:50:54.625 --> 00:50:56.167
you just disappeared.

552
00:51:08.000 --> 00:51:10.042
<i>Let me propose to you. Suzzanna.</i>

553
00:51:21.500 --> 00:51:23.417
I will only accept your proposal

554
00:51:24.167 --> 00:51:26.750
after my mind is completely calm.

555
00:51:27.833 --> 00:51:30.958
And my heart can only be at peace
after I know for sure

556
00:51:31.708 --> 00:51:34.417
who put a spell on my father.

557
00:51:36.875 --> 00:51:39.958
Can you catch that person.

558
00:51:40.542 --> 00:51:43.958
and bring him before
me in a helpless state?

559
00:51:47.833 --> 00:51:49.667
My heart shall be at peace

560
00:51:49.750 --> 00:51:53.500
once you punish your three men.

561
00:51:53.583 --> 00:51:56.375
who had the heart to oppress my mother

562
00:51:56.458 --> 00:51:58.458
until she got sick and died.

563
00:51:59.333 --> 00:52:00.667
They are also the ones

564
00:52:01.417 --> 00:52:04.583
who had been chasing me
until I fell off a cliff.

565
00:52:05.625 --> 00:52:07.833
I was unconscious for a month.

566
00:52:11.708 --> 00:52:14.250
If you can sort it all out.

567
00:52:15.292 --> 00:52:16.500
I will accept your proposal.

568
00:52:28.292 --> 00:52:32.208
The boss will definitely tell Lesus
to put a spell on the three of us.

569
00:52:33.333 --> 00:52:34.417
Impossible.

570
00:52:35.583 --> 00:52:38.125
Boss Bisman is like a brother to us.

571
00:52:38.208 --> 00:52:41.042
Brothers don't put spells on each other.

572
00:52:41.125 --> 00:52:43.833
What do you mean brothers?

573
00:52:44.583 --> 00:52:48.000
Whenever Boss Bisman says we're brothers.
he never means it.

574
00:52:48.083 --> 00:52:52.583
So that we feel close to him.
Loyal to him.

575
00:52:52.667 --> 00:52:54.250
We're not actually brothers!

576
00:52:54.333 --> 00:52:56.458
- Is that so?
- You idiot!

577
00:52:57.458 --> 00:52:59.875
Back when we were porters.

578
00:52:59.958 --> 00:53:02.708
Boss Bisman was already rich.

579
00:53:02.792 --> 00:53:06.458
If he doesn't like us anymore.
it's easy for him to get rid of us.

580
00:53:07.542 --> 00:53:08.750
So…

581
00:53:09.708 --> 00:53:10.958
What should we do?

582
00:53:11.792 --> 00:53:14.083
The source of the problem is Suzzanna.

583
00:53:15.625 --> 00:53:18.083
Suzzanna has poisoned the boss's mind.

584
00:53:18.167 --> 00:53:22.375
If the poison dies.
the boss will come to his senses again.

585
00:53:24.250 --> 00:53:26.583
So we have to kill Suzzanna first.

586
00:53:27.375 --> 00:53:30.042
- Before he finishes us off.
- Hey!

587
00:53:30.667 --> 00:53:33.417
Why are you acting
like a fool just like Lawu?

588
00:53:35.083 --> 00:53:38.042
Better to be a fool but act on it!

589
00:53:38.125 --> 00:53:40.292
Than being smart but cowardly.

590
00:53:41.333 --> 00:53:42.958
If you don't have the guts.

591
00:53:43.583 --> 00:53:45.167
I can go alone!

592
00:54:42.500 --> 00:54:45.000
Huh? Hey. hey.

593
00:54:46.708 --> 00:54:47.708
Hey!

594
00:54:48.583 --> 00:54:49.667
Hey!

595
00:55:48.208 --> 00:55:49.708
Hey. my car!

596
00:59:00.792 --> 00:59:03.167
Boss.

597
00:59:04.333 --> 00:59:07.750
I can't take it anymore.

598
00:59:09.042 --> 00:59:12.833
I'd rather die. Boss.

599
00:59:12.917 --> 00:59:15.958
Nonsense. You must be strong.

600
00:59:16.542 --> 00:59:19.083
I swear to God.

601
00:59:20.083 --> 00:59:21.875
I can't take it.

602
00:59:22.875 --> 00:59:26.833
Please kill me.

603
00:59:28.792 --> 00:59:30.000
Please…

604
00:59:31.250 --> 00:59:33.875
Kill me. Boss.

605
00:59:35.125 --> 00:59:38.000
Please kill me.

606
00:59:39.083 --> 00:59:40.500
Please.

607
00:59:40.583 --> 00:59:44.667
Kill me. Boss.

608
00:59:45.333 --> 00:59:47.792
Kill me. please.

609
00:59:47.875 --> 00:59:49.208
Please…

610
00:59:49.292 --> 00:59:51.167
Forgive me. Banteng.

611
00:59:51.250 --> 00:59:52.667
Just do it.

612
01:00:03.458 --> 01:00:04.583
Boss!

613
01:00:12.250 --> 01:00:14.667
I know what's on your mind.

614
01:00:14.750 --> 01:00:16.167
I swear to God.

615
01:00:17.083 --> 01:00:19.958
I had absolutely no intention
of killing Banteng.

616
01:00:21.500 --> 01:00:25.250
I can't bear
to see him suffering for so long.

617
01:00:27.542 --> 01:00:30.333
Keep God's name out of your mouth. Boss.

618
01:00:31.708 --> 01:00:34.667
God won't even care

619
01:00:35.375 --> 01:00:37.667
that you keep mentioning Him.

620
01:00:39.542 --> 01:00:41.292
As if you practice religion.

621
01:00:54.167 --> 01:00:55.167
Pramuja.

622
01:00:56.500 --> 01:00:57.667
Good evening.

623
01:01:00.042 --> 01:01:02.083
I'm here to give you some food.

624
01:01:03.625 --> 01:01:07.833
I know that you're grieving.
I figured you haven't eaten.

625
01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:12.125
Thank you for the food.

626
01:01:12.917 --> 01:01:13.958
Please come in.

627
01:01:16.375 --> 01:01:17.750
So. Pramuja.

628
01:01:18.458 --> 01:01:20.208
Have you found your father?

629
01:01:22.917 --> 01:01:26.375
It seems like the chief knows
something about my father.

630
01:01:27.375 --> 01:01:29.167
But he's still covering it up.

631
01:01:30.458 --> 01:01:32.083
So when are you going home?

632
01:01:34.042 --> 01:01:36.958
I'm staying here for now.

633
01:01:37.792 --> 01:01:40.500
I want to find out what Bisman is hiding.

634
01:01:42.833 --> 01:01:44.875
You should stay away from Bisman.

635
01:01:46.042 --> 01:01:47.250
He is dangerous.

636
01:01:49.458 --> 01:01:50.750
He killed my father.

637
01:01:57.208 --> 01:01:58.750
I'll just…

638
01:02:01.042 --> 01:02:03.125
Expose his rottenness and help you.

639
01:02:03.208 --> 01:02:05.375
I don't need help.

640
01:02:08.250 --> 01:02:11.250
I don't want anything bad
to happen to you. I don't want you…

641
01:02:14.542 --> 01:02:17.542
I don't want to lose someone
who has been good to me.

642
01:02:19.125 --> 01:02:20.500
Don't be afraid.

643
01:02:21.250 --> 01:02:24.125
I have no fear anymore.

644
01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:30.875
Don't stay here too long.

645
01:02:31.458 --> 01:02:32.583
You are not safe.

646
01:02:33.333 --> 01:02:35.125
They killed your family.

647
01:02:35.208 --> 01:02:38.125
I'll have my revenge on all of them.

648
01:02:38.208 --> 01:02:40.125
In what way?

649
01:02:41.208 --> 01:02:43.208
You are alone. Suzzanna.

650
01:02:43.292 --> 01:02:45.375
You could be the next victim.

651
01:02:46.292 --> 01:02:49.000
Oppression demands rebellion.

652
01:02:50.542 --> 01:02:53.500
If that means I will become a victim.
let it be.

653
01:02:53.583 --> 01:02:55.833
- Suzzanna. you…
- It's getting late.

654
01:03:04.250 --> 01:03:06.625
I… I should go.

655
01:03:14.917 --> 01:03:16.208
Do not forget to eat.

656
01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:23.333
Yesterday a Quran teacher came here.

657
01:03:23.417 --> 01:03:26.667
Saying you were the one
who requested a teacher for me.

658
01:03:26.750 --> 01:03:28.583
Are you mocking me?

659
01:03:28.667 --> 01:03:31.708
Quran teacher? What's his name?

660
01:03:31.792 --> 01:03:33.792
Lastri or something?

661
01:03:34.375 --> 01:03:35.750
A woman?

662
01:03:36.917 --> 01:03:39.042
- Where is she from?
- From Karang Setan. she said.

663
01:03:43.542 --> 01:03:44.583
What does she look like?

664
01:03:45.250 --> 01:03:47.167
Why are you so curious?

665
01:03:47.792 --> 01:03:49.750
- Is she your girlfriend?
- Nonsense.

666
01:03:49.833 --> 01:03:51.625
Just admit it.

667
01:03:51.708 --> 01:03:55.500
If you have no relationship with her.
why would she ask for your photo?

668
01:03:56.125 --> 01:03:57.167
She asked for a photo?

669
01:03:57.750 --> 01:03:59.208
And you gave it to her?

670
01:04:22.750 --> 01:04:25.708
Hey. why are you daydreaming?

671
01:04:26.375 --> 01:04:27.917
You might get possessed.

672
01:04:44.208 --> 01:04:48.292
My beloved children.

673
01:04:48.375 --> 01:04:53.000
<i>Come over.</i>

674
01:04:57.500 --> 01:05:02.667
Tell the man to climb up the coconut tree.

675
01:05:48.042 --> 01:05:51.667
Honey? Who asked for coconuts?

676
01:06:28.917 --> 01:06:31.542
Oh my God. honey!

677
01:06:34.042 --> 01:06:35.208
Honey!

678
01:06:35.292 --> 01:06:36.417
Lawu!

679
01:06:39.833 --> 01:06:41.167
Help!

680
01:06:59.292 --> 01:07:00.625
Boss.

681
01:07:17.000 --> 01:07:18.167
It turns out

682
01:07:19.083 --> 01:07:20.917
for the sake of a woman.

683
01:07:21.708 --> 01:07:25.250
you can so easily sacrifice your own men.

684
01:07:27.250 --> 01:07:29.000
Last week. Banteng died.

685
01:07:29.917 --> 01:07:30.917
Now. look at Lawu.

686
01:07:32.708 --> 01:07:35.542
It's true that I'm mad at you guys.

687
01:07:37.250 --> 01:07:40.958
But I would never
cast spells on my own men.

688
01:07:45.250 --> 01:07:46.250
Hey!

689
01:07:47.917 --> 01:07:49.500
Where are you going?

690
01:07:49.583 --> 01:07:51.500
Come on!

691
01:07:57.042 --> 01:07:58.417
Make him come out!

692
01:07:59.208 --> 01:08:00.208
Lesus!

693
01:08:00.792 --> 01:08:02.042
Come out!

694
01:08:02.125 --> 01:08:03.458
Come out!

695
01:08:04.208 --> 01:08:05.833
Attack! Burn!

696
01:08:09.583 --> 01:08:11.292
Burn everything!

697
01:08:11.375 --> 01:08:12.917
Come on!

698
01:08:19.292 --> 01:08:21.792
He must have a protective spell.

699
01:08:21.875 --> 01:08:23.208
What do you mean?

700
01:08:23.958 --> 01:08:25.458
Try cutting off his big toe.

701
01:08:27.000 --> 01:08:28.917
That's usually their weakness.

702
01:08:29.583 --> 01:08:30.875
Go get him.

703
01:08:30.958 --> 01:08:33.417
- Come on.
- Hey!

704
01:08:33.500 --> 01:08:34.667
Hold him!

705
01:08:34.750 --> 01:08:36.333
Kneel down.

706
01:08:36.417 --> 01:08:38.542
Stab him!

707
01:08:40.708 --> 01:08:41.958
Stab him.

708
01:08:57.125 --> 01:08:58.667
Burn him.

709
01:09:01.667 --> 01:09:03.583
- Come on!
- Burn!

710
01:09:05.917 --> 01:09:08.750
Throw everything in!

711
01:09:09.750 --> 01:09:10.917
Burn!

712
01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:12.042
Hey. here.

713
01:09:24.042 --> 01:09:25.417
Burn him!

714
01:09:26.583 --> 01:09:29.583
- Let's go home!
- Let's go!

715
01:10:07.417 --> 01:10:08.500
Boss?

716
01:10:28.792 --> 01:10:30.417
What is it. Kawi?

717
01:10:30.500 --> 01:10:31.750
Don't worry.

718
01:10:32.417 --> 01:10:34.292
I'm not here to mess around.

719
01:10:34.792 --> 01:10:36.958
I'm relieved because

720
01:10:37.042 --> 01:10:40.125
you can't possibly cast any spells
on me and Lawu anymore.

721
01:10:40.208 --> 01:10:43.292
Your favorite shaman.

722
01:10:43.375 --> 01:10:45.042
has become a corpse.

723
01:10:47.250 --> 01:10:49.250
You stupid son of a bitch!

724
01:10:50.042 --> 01:10:51.417
Why kill him?

725
01:10:51.500 --> 01:10:53.833
I've said it many times

726
01:10:53.917 --> 01:10:57.042
that I never ordered anyone
to finish you off!

727
01:10:58.583 --> 01:11:01.667
I'm already confused. Kawi!
Now I'm even more confused!

728
01:11:12.333 --> 01:11:13.542
Honey?

729
01:11:13.625 --> 01:11:15.125
Honey?

730
01:11:15.208 --> 01:11:16.208
Lawu?

731
01:11:16.875 --> 01:11:17.917
Wu. Lawu!

732
01:11:18.833 --> 01:11:19.833
Lawu?

733
01:11:26.667 --> 01:11:27.667
Nurse!

734
01:11:34.875 --> 01:11:36.333
Wu. Lawu!

735
01:12:25.500 --> 01:12:30.125
Look! Do you really think that Lesus
can still send spells?

736
01:12:31.125 --> 01:12:32.333
Lawu!

737
01:12:33.083 --> 01:12:34.417
Honey!

738
01:12:34.500 --> 01:12:37.458
Lawu. wake up honey!

739
01:12:41.417 --> 01:12:42.750
Peace be upon you.

740
01:12:42.833 --> 01:12:45.167
And upon you too. Can I help you?

741
01:12:45.250 --> 01:12:47.750
I want to meet the chief.

742
01:12:48.833 --> 01:12:50.417
Please wait.

743
01:12:50.500 --> 01:12:52.000
Have a seat.

744
01:12:52.083 --> 01:12:53.083
Thank you.

745
01:12:54.917 --> 01:12:56.167
So…

746
01:12:56.250 --> 01:12:59.042
Who actually cast spells
on Banteng and Lawu?

747
01:12:59.875 --> 01:13:01.417
Sorry. Boss.

748
01:13:01.500 --> 01:13:04.958
I still don't know who did it.

749
01:13:05.708 --> 01:13:08.500
But. whoever he is.

750
01:13:08.583 --> 01:13:12.750
I think. he acted on Suzzanna's request.

751
01:13:13.500 --> 01:13:16.167
Why do you think so?

752
01:13:16.750 --> 01:13:17.875
Do you think

753
01:13:17.958 --> 01:13:20.917
there's anyone else who has a grudge
against us more than her?

754
01:13:23.958 --> 01:13:27.042
Kliwon! Tohir! Diran!

755
01:13:27.125 --> 01:13:28.417
- Yes!
- Yes. Boss!

756
01:13:28.500 --> 01:13:29.708
Yes. Boss?

757
01:13:32.667 --> 01:13:34.875
Starting today. you three

758
01:13:34.958 --> 01:13:37.917
keep an eye on Suzzanna 24 hours a day.

759
01:13:38.000 --> 01:13:42.417
If you see her entertaining guests.
or if there is someone suspicious.

760
01:13:42.500 --> 01:13:43.625
report to me immediately.

761
01:13:44.333 --> 01:13:46.125
That person might be the shaman.

762
01:13:47.375 --> 01:13:49.208
Or his men that Suzzanna hired.

763
01:13:49.292 --> 01:13:51.042
- Understood?
- Understood. Boss.

764
01:13:51.125 --> 01:13:54.875
If you can tell me who the shaman is.

765
01:13:54.958 --> 01:13:57.167
I will triple your salary.

766
01:13:57.833 --> 01:13:59.625
So. keep your eyes open.

767
01:14:04.167 --> 01:14:06.000
Hey. you!

768
01:14:10.667 --> 01:14:12.167
What are you doing there?

769
01:14:12.833 --> 01:14:13.875
I…

770
01:14:14.542 --> 01:14:18.250
I want to ask about my father.
Do you have time?

771
01:14:18.333 --> 01:14:20.792
- What's your name again?
- Pramuja.

772
01:14:20.875 --> 01:14:24.042
I told you. your father is dead.

773
01:14:25.458 --> 01:14:27.500
So. I'm sorry.

774
01:14:27.583 --> 01:14:29.417
There's nothing I can do.

775
01:14:33.708 --> 01:14:35.917
Remember. open your eyes.

776
01:14:36.000 --> 01:14:38.750
We have to keep looking for the shaman.

777
01:14:39.583 --> 01:14:43.750
For triple salary. I'd even meet a ghost.

778
01:14:45.333 --> 01:14:46.917
But this is a dark shaman.

779
01:14:47.000 --> 01:14:48.083
What do you mean?

780
01:14:48.167 --> 01:14:50.667
Well. if it's a ghost. we can run away.

781
01:14:50.750 --> 01:14:53.542
But if it's a shaman.
wherever we go. his spells will follow us.

782
01:14:55.417 --> 01:14:56.750
You're right.

783
01:14:57.917 --> 01:14:59.042
Gosh.

784
01:15:01.000 --> 01:15:02.792
I'm scared now.

785
01:15:03.750 --> 01:15:04.625
Gosh.

786
01:15:04.708 --> 01:15:08.083
Besides. how are we supposed to know

787
01:15:08.167 --> 01:15:09.667
if a person is a black magic shaman?

788
01:15:09.750 --> 01:15:11.667
My grandmother said.

789
01:15:11.750 --> 01:15:16.292
black magic shamans usually
own a keris and a voodoo doll.

790
01:15:17.250 --> 01:15:21.125
Whoever owns those items
must be the black magic shaman.

791
01:15:22.625 --> 01:15:23.946
I'm getting more and more scared.

792
01:15:24.750 --> 01:15:25.750
Me too.

793
01:15:27.917 --> 01:15:29.000
Tohir. come here.

794
01:15:31.417 --> 01:15:33.667
You and I. check over there. okay?

795
01:15:34.333 --> 01:15:36.125
Diran. you check over there.

796
01:15:37.875 --> 01:15:39.167
Why am I alone?

797
01:15:39.250 --> 01:15:41.292
No need to be afraid like that.

798
01:15:41.375 --> 01:15:42.583
Come on. Tohir.

799
01:15:44.042 --> 01:15:45.792
Tohir? Kliwon?

800
01:15:47.417 --> 01:15:48.458
Geez.

801
01:15:54.917 --> 01:15:56.042
Suzzanna.

802
01:15:56.583 --> 01:15:59.250
- Why are you still here?
- I need to tell you something.

803
01:16:13.250 --> 01:16:14.833
I met Bisman earlier.

804
01:16:14.917 --> 01:16:18.833
and I heard his men think
that you hired a black magic shaman

805
01:16:18.917 --> 01:16:20.125
to put a spell on them.

806
01:16:21.833 --> 01:16:25.792
Now. they have sent people to spy on you.
We have to get out of here immediately.

807
01:16:27.292 --> 01:16:28.667
You are not safe alone.

808
01:16:29.750 --> 01:16:31.500
I cannot leave. Pramuja.

809
01:16:31.583 --> 01:16:33.458
What are you thinking. Suzzanna?

810
01:16:34.875 --> 01:16:36.667
You can't fight them alone.

811
01:16:37.208 --> 01:16:40.042
They're crazy for thinking
that you cast a spell on them.

812
01:16:40.958 --> 01:16:42.708
You don't understand.

813
01:16:46.208 --> 01:16:47.292
You better go.

814
01:16:48.458 --> 01:16:50.625
We'll meet again after everything is done.

815
01:16:50.708 --> 01:16:52.583
I don't understand what you are thinking.

816
01:16:57.208 --> 01:16:58.292
A crow?

817
01:17:37.458 --> 01:17:40.500
Why did you have to learn things like this
from Aunt Gayatri?

818
01:17:40.583 --> 01:17:42.208
This is the only way.

819
01:17:42.292 --> 01:17:44.167
The only way for whom?

820
01:17:46.083 --> 01:17:48.250
For people who don't
believe in the power of God?

821
01:17:49.208 --> 01:17:51.042
You're not that kind of person. Suzzanna.

822
01:17:51.125 --> 01:17:53.833
Not everyone is as unfortunate as I am.

823
01:17:53.917 --> 01:17:58.083
And not everyone who suffers misfortune
chooses this path.

824
01:18:01.292 --> 01:18:04.000
What kind of path do
you think I should take?

825
01:18:06.292 --> 01:18:07.292
Pray?

826
01:18:08.375 --> 01:18:10.833
And continue to pray for God's protection?

827
01:18:10.917 --> 01:18:11.917
Suzzanna.

828
01:18:13.833 --> 01:18:16.875
For years I prayed
to Him with all my heart.

829
01:18:17.708 --> 01:18:19.125
Believing that He exists.

830
01:18:22.208 --> 01:18:25.542
Believing in His strength and power.

831
01:18:25.625 --> 01:18:27.583
That He will always protect me.

832
01:18:28.875 --> 01:18:31.500
And protect the people I love.

833
01:18:35.000 --> 01:18:36.083
My father.

834
01:18:37.417 --> 01:18:38.417
My mother.

835
01:18:41.417 --> 01:18:42.750
But then what?

836
01:18:44.458 --> 01:18:47.708
When evil people killed my father.

837
01:18:48.542 --> 01:18:50.000
and oppressed my mother…

838
01:18:52.375 --> 01:18:54.167
Did God help me?

839
01:18:54.875 --> 01:18:56.333
No.

840
01:18:59.917 --> 01:19:02.208
- Suzzanna. you…
- Miss Suzzanna?

841
01:19:09.958 --> 01:19:11.083
What's wrong?

842
01:19:12.917 --> 01:19:15.875
I thought I heard a man's voice.

843
01:19:16.875 --> 01:19:18.417
Is there anyone else here?

844
01:19:19.667 --> 01:19:21.125
There's no one else here.

845
01:19:24.000 --> 01:19:26.750
If you want. please see for yourself.

846
01:19:27.583 --> 01:19:28.583
Yes.

847
01:19:29.125 --> 01:19:30.125
Excuse me.

848
01:20:20.417 --> 01:20:21.875
What's wrong?

849
01:20:22.917 --> 01:20:25.875
What you said is true. Miss.
There's no one else here.

850
01:20:28.750 --> 01:20:30.708
Sit down. I'll make you a drink.

851
01:20:30.792 --> 01:20:32.958
No thank you. I'm full.

852
01:20:34.125 --> 01:20:35.208
Gosh.

853
01:20:47.875 --> 01:20:48.917
Kliwon!

854
01:20:50.250 --> 01:20:52.083
Sorry. Tohir! Sorry. sorry.

855
01:20:54.375 --> 01:20:57.042
Kliwon? Tohir!

856
01:20:57.958 --> 01:20:59.792
Danger. Danger!

857
01:20:59.875 --> 01:21:01.708
Ghost!

858
01:21:01.792 --> 01:21:03.833
- Ghost…
- This is Tohir. not a ghost!

859
01:21:04.583 --> 01:21:06.333
I know who the black magic shaman is.

860
01:21:06.417 --> 01:21:07.250
- Really?
- Who?

861
01:21:07.333 --> 01:21:09.917
Let's just report it to the boss.
shall we?

862
01:21:10.000 --> 01:21:12.208
Hey. Diran. wait!

863
01:21:12.292 --> 01:21:14.167
You're not the only one
who wants a raise! Hey!

864
01:21:15.875 --> 01:21:17.125
He figured it out.

865
01:21:18.333 --> 01:21:20.792
He will report to Bisman soon.

866
01:21:21.458 --> 01:21:23.125
Don't you worry.

867
01:21:24.042 --> 01:21:26.625
He won't be able to tell anyone.

868
01:21:49.542 --> 01:21:51.542
I'm not as nice as you think.

869
01:21:53.208 --> 01:21:54.333
You better go.

870
01:22:01.542 --> 01:22:02.625
Leave. Pramuja.

871
01:22:41.417 --> 01:22:43.292
I have no business with you guys.

872
01:22:46.792 --> 01:22:48.750
DANGDUT NIGHT CLUB

873
01:23:07.375 --> 01:23:09.708
What were you doing at Suzzanna's house?

874
01:23:11.792 --> 01:23:14.292
Protecting her from people like you.

875
01:23:16.375 --> 01:23:18.125
Who's protecting who?

876
01:23:18.875 --> 01:23:21.917
You can't even protect yourself.

877
01:23:23.083 --> 01:23:25.333
I am in charge here.

878
01:23:26.125 --> 01:23:28.958
And I will destroy
whoever goes against me.

879
01:23:31.083 --> 01:23:34.542
I am not afraid of people like you.

880
01:24:35.708 --> 01:24:36.958
What happened?

881
01:24:37.042 --> 01:24:38.958
I got pushed by Kliwon. Boss.

882
01:24:39.042 --> 01:24:40.292
What are you doing here?

883
01:24:40.917 --> 01:24:42.958
Aren't you supposed
to be watching Suzzanna's house?

884
01:24:44.667 --> 01:24:46.500
I have important news. Boss.

885
01:24:46.583 --> 01:24:48.958
- You definitely won't believe it.
- What news?

886
01:24:49.042 --> 01:24:51.458
I know who the black magic shaman is.

887
01:24:53.958 --> 01:24:55.000
Who is it?

888
01:24:55.083 --> 01:24:56.542
The black magic shaman is…

889
01:24:59.208 --> 01:25:00.250
Don't mess with me!

890
01:25:01.250 --> 01:25:02.500
Quickly. tell me who!

891
01:25:02.583 --> 01:25:05.208
Well. Boss. the black magic shaman is…

892
01:25:05.917 --> 01:25:07.625
Can you talk or not?

893
01:25:07.708 --> 01:25:09.083
Yes. I can.

894
01:25:09.167 --> 01:25:10.875
The black magic shaman is…

895
01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:15.250
You two. weren't you with him earlier?

896
01:25:15.333 --> 01:25:16.542
Yes. Boss.

897
01:25:16.625 --> 01:25:18.167
So who is the shaman?

898
01:25:18.250 --> 01:25:20.583
- I don't know. Boss.
- I don't know either.

899
01:25:20.667 --> 01:25:23.125
Did you see anyone enter Suzzanna's house?

900
01:25:23.208 --> 01:25:24.917
- No.
- No. Boss.

901
01:25:25.000 --> 01:25:27.333
One is stuttering.
and the other two don't know anything.

902
01:25:27.417 --> 01:25:30.292
It's useless for me
to talk to stupid people like you.

903
01:25:34.708 --> 01:25:35.708
Hey!

904
01:25:36.167 --> 01:25:37.958
Do you want to get us killed?

905
01:25:38.042 --> 01:25:40.208
Huh? We can get killed?

906
01:25:40.292 --> 01:25:42.375
We might if this keeps happening.

907
01:25:42.458 --> 01:25:46.125
Why would you report to the boss
without knowing who the shaman is?

908
01:25:46.833 --> 01:25:49.375
I actually know. I saw it.

909
01:25:50.333 --> 01:25:54.417
That's why I want to talk to the boss.
But it couldn't come out.

910
01:25:54.500 --> 01:25:56.542
Can't you just write
the name of the shaman?

911
01:25:57.208 --> 01:25:58.542
Here. write it down.

912
01:25:58.625 --> 01:26:00.375
I can't read or write.

913
01:26:00.458 --> 01:26:03.583
Wow. you're stuttering and illiterate.

914
01:26:03.667 --> 01:26:05.250
Can you read and write?

915
01:26:06.000 --> 01:26:08.000
- I can't.
- Geez.

916
01:26:08.583 --> 01:26:10.875
I'm having a hard
time listening to you two.

917
01:26:10.958 --> 01:26:12.292
How are we supposed to improve.

918
01:26:12.375 --> 01:26:14.542
if the quality of our human resources
is this low?

919
01:26:21.000 --> 01:26:22.792
What's wrong with them?

920
01:26:22.875 --> 01:26:24.667
I just wanted to tell them

921
01:26:24.750 --> 01:26:26.792
that the black magic shaman is Suzzanna.

922
01:26:27.375 --> 01:26:29.292
Huh. I said it?

923
01:26:30.125 --> 01:26:32.917
I think she put a spell on me.

924
01:28:42.833 --> 01:28:45.667
Scattered from the world.

925
01:28:45.750 --> 01:28:47.250
everything lies in ruin.

926
01:29:01.542 --> 01:29:03.875
Purged. without a trace.

927
01:30:25.792 --> 01:30:26.833
Not bad.

928
01:30:27.542 --> 01:30:29.292
You spent months away from this village.

929
01:30:30.250 --> 01:30:32.042
And mastered
witchcraft before coming home.

930
01:30:32.667 --> 01:30:33.667
Too bad.

931
01:30:33.750 --> 01:30:36.375
You think too highly of yourself.

932
01:30:37.083 --> 01:30:39.667
You think you can beat everyone.

933
01:30:39.750 --> 01:30:42.333
I have never studied witchcraft.

934
01:30:43.292 --> 01:30:44.708
But just so you know.

935
01:30:44.792 --> 01:30:46.292
from Ponorogo.

936
01:30:46.917 --> 01:30:48.500
up to Banyuwangi.

937
01:30:49.625 --> 01:30:52.000
I know many shamans.

938
01:30:53.292 --> 01:30:56.708
And every one gave me something
to protect myself.

939
01:30:58.708 --> 01:31:00.292
It's okay.

940
01:31:00.375 --> 01:31:02.625
Let's just forget the past.

941
01:31:03.833 --> 01:31:05.792
You should focus

942
01:31:05.875 --> 01:31:07.625
on having a better future.

943
01:31:08.375 --> 01:31:10.375
By accepting my proposal.

944
01:31:14.167 --> 01:31:16.208
I'm still waiting

945
01:31:16.792 --> 01:31:19.708
for you to complete
the requirements I told you.

946
01:31:20.708 --> 01:31:22.750
I've helped finish off two men.

947
01:31:23.917 --> 01:31:26.917
There is one more
left. who is still alive.

948
01:31:48.292 --> 01:31:52.667
Tomorrow morning. take me to Ponorogo.
I want to visit Mbah Kodrat.

949
01:31:55.667 --> 01:31:57.167
<i>You realize.</i>

950
01:31:57.250 --> 01:32:03.167
<i>what could happen if I put
a soul-split spell on your future wife?</i>

951
01:32:03.250 --> 01:32:06.083
- I understand.
- Won't you be disappointed?

952
01:32:06.667 --> 01:32:09.083
That you're marrying a completely
different woman?

953
01:32:10.208 --> 01:32:11.375
No. Mbah.

954
01:32:12.208 --> 01:32:13.583
It's better that way.

955
01:32:14.667 --> 01:32:19.042
Instead of having her recognize me.
and hate me all my life.

956
01:33:39.958 --> 01:33:42.167
Do you know where you are?

957
01:33:48.250 --> 01:33:49.708
What's your name?

958
01:33:53.000 --> 01:33:55.000
If you don't know what your name is.

959
01:33:55.667 --> 01:33:58.708
I will give you the name Suzzanna.

960
01:34:23.792 --> 01:34:25.417
You should eat.

961
01:34:26.458 --> 01:34:28.708
You haven't eaten since yesterday.

962
01:34:52.333 --> 01:34:54.167
Why did you come back here?

963
01:34:55.083 --> 01:34:56.792
Because I still want to find my father.

964
01:34:56.875 --> 01:34:58.250
What is your mother's name?

965
01:34:58.917 --> 01:35:00.042
Astuti.

966
01:35:06.667 --> 01:35:07.875
Here's the photo.

967
01:35:07.958 --> 01:35:11.458
But I don't have a photo of my father.
She said my father was a sailor.

968
01:35:12.500 --> 01:35:15.667
And he had an accident
when she gave birth to me.

969
01:35:26.833 --> 01:35:28.292
Your father lied.

970
01:35:30.208 --> 01:35:31.375
He was not a sailor.

971
01:35:32.125 --> 01:35:34.167
His name is not Kasman either.

972
01:35:34.250 --> 01:35:38.083
He faked his name
and claimed to be a sailor.

973
01:35:38.167 --> 01:35:41.292
to find an excuse to
leave your mother often.

974
01:35:41.375 --> 01:35:43.750
Because he had lovers everywhere.

975
01:35:44.500 --> 01:35:48.458
After that. your father left this village.
and never came back again.

976
01:35:49.333 --> 01:35:50.574
Do you know where my father is?

977
01:35:50.625 --> 01:35:56.208
I'll tell you where your father is. only
after you answer my questions honestly.

978
01:35:56.292 --> 01:35:58.333
God willing. I will answer honestly. sir.

979
01:36:00.042 --> 01:36:02.708
What is your real purpose
in coming to Karang Setan?

980
01:36:03.792 --> 01:36:05.958
- To look for my father.
- Liar.

981
01:36:06.542 --> 01:36:10.042
- You came here for Suzzanna. didn't you?
- No.

982
01:36:10.125 --> 01:36:13.583
What is your relationship with her?
Why do you feel the need to come here?

983
01:36:13.667 --> 01:36:15.333
Do you love her?

984
01:36:22.292 --> 01:36:25.042
Why are you asking about
my relationship with Suzzanna?

985
01:36:25.625 --> 01:36:28.208
Because soon she will marry me.

986
01:36:29.750 --> 01:36:34.167
And I have to make sure
no one else has any objections.

987
01:36:34.250 --> 01:36:36.542
Suzzanna will not marry you.

988
01:36:37.625 --> 01:36:39.333
Unless you force her.

989
01:36:40.208 --> 01:36:41.875
As long as I am alive.

990
01:36:42.667 --> 01:36:45.875
I will make sure that will never happen.

991
01:36:46.667 --> 01:36:48.208
We shall see.

992
01:37:04.667 --> 01:37:06.042
Suzzanna.

993
01:37:07.500 --> 01:37:10.583
Put down the broom. We'll talk inside.

994
01:37:14.417 --> 01:37:15.625
Suzzanna?

995
01:37:16.625 --> 01:37:18.125
Who are you?

996
01:37:22.000 --> 01:37:25.208
Just wait inside. Okay?

997
01:37:35.208 --> 01:37:36.750
What did you do to her?

998
01:37:37.792 --> 01:37:40.042
Which shaman did you ask
to corrupt her mind?

999
01:37:40.125 --> 01:37:41.292
None of your business.

1000
01:37:42.042 --> 01:37:44.250
Soon. she will be my wife.

1001
01:37:51.625 --> 01:37:52.833
Enough.

1002
01:37:53.458 --> 01:37:55.542
Let's just finish him off. Boss.

1003
01:37:56.208 --> 01:37:59.417
No. Give him supplies
to go home to Kalinegoro.

1004
01:38:00.958 --> 01:38:02.042
Take him.

1005
01:38:42.333 --> 01:38:43.500
Who are you?

1006
01:38:46.542 --> 01:38:47.792
You're an officer. right?

1007
01:38:48.708 --> 01:38:50.934
What are you doing peeking into
the bridal chamber like this?

1008
01:38:50.958 --> 01:38:52.351
Do you want to be beaten up by the chief?

1009
01:38:52.375 --> 01:38:55.083
No! I don't mean to harm Suzzanna.

1010
01:38:55.167 --> 01:38:58.000
- I swear!
- If you don't mean any harm.

1011
01:38:58.917 --> 01:39:00.208
why are you acting like a thief?

1012
01:39:00.292 --> 01:39:03.375
And what are you doing here? Perhaps…

1013
01:39:04.125 --> 01:39:07.292
- Are you a thief calling me a thief?
- I came here to help Suzzanna.

1014
01:39:07.375 --> 01:39:08.542
Me too!

1015
01:39:10.083 --> 01:39:11.792
- Can you help me?
- Yes.

1016
01:39:24.583 --> 01:39:25.875
VILLAGE TRANSPORTATION

1017
01:39:33.500 --> 01:39:34.684
- Come on. pick her up.
- Come on.

1018
01:39:34.708 --> 01:39:36.542
Watch her head.

1019
01:39:36.625 --> 01:39:37.667
Watch it.

1020
01:39:39.000 --> 01:39:40.208
Pull her up.

1021
01:39:44.917 --> 01:39:47.750
- So you guys have repented?
- Whatever. shut up.

1022
01:40:00.208 --> 01:40:01.583
WELCOME TO KARANG SETAN VILLAGE

1023
01:40:06.042 --> 01:40:07.083
Auntie?

1024
01:40:17.917 --> 01:40:19.083
Suzzanna?

1025
01:40:20.042 --> 01:40:22.958
Sorry. Auntie. I had to come back.

1026
01:40:23.708 --> 01:40:24.958
For Suzzanna's sake.

1027
01:40:25.583 --> 01:40:27.083
Someone made her lose her memory.

1028
01:40:27.167 --> 01:40:30.208
The soul-split spell.

1029
01:40:31.833 --> 01:40:34.167
Her body is strong enough
not to drive her crazy.

1030
01:40:35.208 --> 01:40:36.750
But the treatment you taught me…

1031
01:40:36.833 --> 01:40:38.250
I haven't mastered it yet.

1032
01:40:38.333 --> 01:40:42.042
You don't need to
learn strange things like me.

1033
01:40:42.917 --> 01:40:45.083
Come on. Come inside.

1034
01:40:46.125 --> 01:40:47.125
Come.

1035
01:40:50.708 --> 01:40:51.792
Come on. dear.

1036
01:40:53.167 --> 01:40:54.292
Come on.

1037
01:41:03.208 --> 01:41:05.875
If you don't mind.
I'll leave Suzzanna here for now.

1038
01:41:07.583 --> 01:41:10.125
I have something to do in Karang Setan.

1039
01:41:15.042 --> 01:41:16.958
With pleasure. my boy.

1040
01:41:19.208 --> 01:41:20.708
Be careful. okay?

1041
01:41:27.083 --> 01:41:28.917
Forgive me. will you?

1042
01:41:33.583 --> 01:41:36.167
If you still want to stay here.

1043
01:41:37.458 --> 01:41:39.042
I won't kick you out.

1044
01:41:40.417 --> 01:41:43.458
My house is your house too.

1045
01:42:22.417 --> 01:42:23.292
Who are you?

1046
01:42:23.375 --> 01:42:24.875
Who the hell are you?

1047
01:42:36.375 --> 01:42:39.708
Do you want to know what dying feels like?

1048
01:42:40.708 --> 01:42:43.083
Feel it

1049
01:42:43.167 --> 01:42:45.583
before you die.

1050
01:43:16.208 --> 01:43:17.583
Tell me.

1051
01:43:17.667 --> 01:43:20.750
Who told you to bother Suzzanna?

1052
01:43:21.542 --> 01:43:23.292
It's none of your business!

1053
01:43:24.667 --> 01:43:26.208
It sure is.

1054
01:43:27.083 --> 01:43:28.750
Whoever decides

1055
01:43:28.833 --> 01:43:31.750
to bother Suzzanna
will be dealing with me.

1056
01:44:00.292 --> 01:44:01.292
Oh. no.

1057
01:44:37.208 --> 01:44:40.958
Now… It's time for you to die.

1058
01:44:44.750 --> 01:44:47.958
Die. Gayatri. Die!

1059
01:44:50.458 --> 01:44:56.792
Your time here is over.

1060
01:45:01.208 --> 01:45:02.500
Hey!

1061
01:45:03.292 --> 01:45:09.750
I know your soul is lodged in your throat.

1062
01:45:14.042 --> 01:45:15.417
Once I bind you.

1063
01:45:15.958 --> 01:45:18.208
you will become my puppet.

1064
01:45:21.167 --> 01:45:26.042
Face the full moon's light.

1065
01:45:26.125 --> 01:45:27.958
old shaman!

1066
01:46:34.333 --> 01:46:35.417
Tohir.

1067
01:46:35.500 --> 01:46:36.875
How did it go?

1068
01:46:37.583 --> 01:46:39.500
- I can't find her.
- You can't?

1069
01:46:40.542 --> 01:46:41.625
Hey. where's Kliwon?

1070
01:46:41.708 --> 01:46:43.625
Getting dolled up. Wait. what?

1071
01:46:43.708 --> 01:46:45.625
You think Kliwon is
the one getting married?

1072
01:46:45.708 --> 01:46:49.417
- Sorry. Boss. I mean…
- Has Suzzanna finished her makeup?

1073
01:46:49.500 --> 01:46:51.667
I've been looking. Boss

1074
01:46:51.750 --> 01:46:55.000
I'm asking about Suzzanna.
It has nothing to do with Kliwon.

1075
01:46:55.083 --> 01:46:58.583
I'm also answering about Suzzanna.
Not about Kliwon.

1076
01:46:58.667 --> 01:47:01.833
Why did you say you're looking?
Is she missing?

1077
01:47:01.917 --> 01:47:04.625
If she wasn't.
I wouldn't be looking for her.

1078
01:47:04.708 --> 01:47:07.542
- Do you know where Suzzanna is?
- No. Boss.

1079
01:47:08.750 --> 01:47:12.083
Kawi! Where's Suzzanna?

1080
01:47:20.708 --> 01:47:24.167
It seems like he wants to kill your soul.

1081
01:47:25.458 --> 01:47:27.458
Without damaging your body.

1082
01:47:28.958 --> 01:47:33.792
Let me learn what it takes
to get rid of his protection. Ma'am.

1083
01:47:33.875 --> 01:47:37.375
His defense is too strong for me to fight.

1084
01:47:39.542 --> 01:47:41.792
About his protection.

1085
01:47:42.750 --> 01:47:44.000
let me handle it.

1086
01:47:45.458 --> 01:47:47.542
But to attack him.

1087
01:47:47.625 --> 01:47:50.292
there is actually one thing

1088
01:47:50.375 --> 01:47:53.958
which I haven't taught
because it's too dangerous.

1089
01:47:54.042 --> 01:47:55.708
It is called…

1090
01:47:56.542 --> 01:47:58.750
The bamboo-bundle spell.

1091
01:47:59.500 --> 01:48:02.625
Its power is equal to the death-hex.

1092
01:48:02.708 --> 01:48:07.250
but it won't strike only Bisman.

1093
01:48:08.333 --> 01:48:12.083
All of his descendants
will perish as well.

1094
01:48:13.083 --> 01:48:15.500
Bisman has no descendants. Ma'am.

1095
01:48:17.375 --> 01:48:20.500
There will be no
victims other than himself.

1096
01:48:21.625 --> 01:48:23.000
I will teach it to you

1097
01:48:23.625 --> 01:48:25.750
but only for one attack.

1098
01:48:25.833 --> 01:48:28.208
And this cannot be undone.

1099
01:48:29.042 --> 01:48:30.917
If you try to undo it.

1100
01:48:31.625 --> 01:48:36.000
its destructive power will return
to hit the sender.

1101
01:48:37.000 --> 01:48:38.792
To hit you.

1102
01:48:53.167 --> 01:48:54.625
Listen. everyone.

1103
01:48:55.917 --> 01:48:58.208
This is Boss Bisman's order.

1104
01:48:59.167 --> 01:49:00.792
All of you

1105
01:49:00.875 --> 01:49:04.708
must work together
to look for Suzzanna until you find her.

1106
01:49:04.792 --> 01:49:07.833
If Suzzanna is still not found by sunset.

1107
01:49:08.417 --> 01:49:10.750
you have to bear the consequences.

1108
01:49:11.958 --> 01:49:15.417
Boss Bisman will only give you time
until tomorrow night

1109
01:49:16.000 --> 01:49:19.125
for you to pay off your debts.

1110
01:49:21.750 --> 01:49:23.708
What? What?

1111
01:49:24.292 --> 01:49:28.167
If you don't agree. come up here!
Don't grumble behind my back.

1112
01:49:29.833 --> 01:49:30.833
Why so silent?

1113
01:49:32.125 --> 01:49:33.958
Get out of here. Scatter!

1114
01:49:34.042 --> 01:49:36.375
Hurry up and find Suzzanna!

1115
01:49:36.458 --> 01:49:38.167
That's not their job.

1116
01:49:39.000 --> 01:49:40.000
Huh?

1117
01:49:40.917 --> 01:49:42.458
Who said that?

1118
01:49:52.458 --> 01:49:54.250
I'm not from here.

1119
01:49:55.375 --> 01:49:58.750
But I know this is just your trick
to make them pay their debts.

1120
01:49:59.625 --> 01:50:03.208
Don't mess around
with Boss Bisman's orders.

1121
01:50:03.292 --> 01:50:07.000
<i>Even the stupidest person in this village
knows that your order is unreasonable.</i>

1122
01:50:07.083 --> 01:50:09.417
Pass these around.

1123
01:50:09.500 --> 01:50:13.542
<i>If Suzzanna really disappeared.
she could have run to Ngawi.</i>

1124
01:50:13.625 --> 01:50:15.458
<i>Jombang. Kediri.</i>

1125
01:50:15.542 --> 01:50:18.625
<i>so you're saying that we should
search all the villages?</i>

1126
01:50:18.708 --> 01:50:21.500
All the towns? Do you all
want to look for Suzzanna everywhere?

1127
01:50:21.583 --> 01:50:24.500
- No!
- No. no!

1128
01:50:24.583 --> 01:50:26.750
- Shut up!
- No!

1129
01:50:26.833 --> 01:50:30.000
Whether this concerns Suzzanna or not.

1130
01:50:30.083 --> 01:50:32.250
a debt is a debt.

1131
01:50:32.333 --> 01:50:33.750
Who put them in debt?

1132
01:50:35.500 --> 01:50:36.500
You must know.

1133
01:50:36.958 --> 01:50:38.333
Five years ago.

1134
01:50:38.417 --> 01:50:39.809
Boss Bisman deliberately spread pests.

1135
01:50:39.833 --> 01:50:41.793
and destroyed all the rice fields
in this village.

1136
01:50:42.292 --> 01:50:43.500
Tens of hectares in number.

1137
01:50:44.458 --> 01:50:45.809
Then after the crop failed. what happened?

1138
01:50:45.833 --> 01:50:49.125
They were all forced to borrow money
from Boss Bisman.

1139
01:50:49.208 --> 01:50:52.000
If they wanted to pay their debts.
they mortgaged their rice fields.

1140
01:50:52.083 --> 01:50:56.333
Become laborers on their own rice fields
which are now owned by Boss Bisman. right?

1141
01:50:56.417 --> 01:50:58.250
That's right. that's right!

1142
01:50:58.833 --> 01:51:00.750
I experienced it myself.

1143
01:51:00.833 --> 01:51:02.500
This is colonization.

1144
01:51:03.083 --> 01:51:04.208
Oppression.

1145
01:51:05.542 --> 01:51:07.667
Pursuing wealth to gain power.

1146
01:51:08.417 --> 01:51:12.125
Using power to make yourself richer
by causing misery to others.

1147
01:51:12.208 --> 01:51:13.792
Do you want to keep being oppressed?

1148
01:51:13.875 --> 01:51:15.542
No!

1149
01:51:15.625 --> 01:51:17.250
Do you want to keep being wronged?

1150
01:51:17.333 --> 01:51:23.125
- No.
- No!

1151
01:51:23.208 --> 01:51:25.458
This is slander. Beat him up. Get him!

1152
01:52:26.417 --> 01:52:29.333
We have to get the cash safe
in the café cupboard.

1153
01:52:58.417 --> 01:53:00.958
Bisman! Where are you?

1154
01:53:04.458 --> 01:53:05.583
Come on. Boss.

1155
01:53:09.250 --> 01:53:12.042
Bisman is getting away!

1156
01:53:12.125 --> 01:53:15.000
Bisman! Don't run away!

1157
01:53:15.083 --> 01:53:18.042
Bisman!

1158
01:53:35.750 --> 01:53:37.958
Let's go!

1159
01:53:48.833 --> 01:53:50.542
Hey. lock all the doors!

1160
01:53:55.208 --> 01:53:58.292
Come on. guys! Come on!

1161
01:54:09.000 --> 01:54:10.042
The key is at home.

1162
01:54:15.625 --> 01:54:17.667
Attack. don't be afraid!

1163
01:55:10.917 --> 01:55:11.958
Here. Boss.

1164
01:55:24.708 --> 01:55:26.250
Wait here. Boss.

1165
01:56:10.167 --> 01:56:11.292
Take that!

1166
01:56:25.292 --> 01:56:26.333
Bisman!

1167
01:56:56.542 --> 01:57:00.292
I humbly ask for your help.

1168
01:57:38.667 --> 01:57:40.042
Boss…

1169
01:58:47.542 --> 01:58:48.667
Help me.

1170
01:58:49.667 --> 01:58:50.958
Help.

1171
01:59:04.583 --> 01:59:05.583
Wait.

1172
01:59:06.875 --> 01:59:07.917
Help…

1173
01:59:45.500 --> 01:59:47.500
SATRIYO SON OF WARYONO

1174
01:59:51.458 --> 01:59:54.625
SUTINI. DAUGHTER OF PRAYITNO

1175
01:59:57.542 --> 01:59:58.542
Suzzanna.

1176
01:59:59.917 --> 02:00:01.458
I feel worthless.

1177
02:00:02.375 --> 02:00:05.417
- Seeing my parents' grave.
- Suzzanna.

1178
02:00:06.042 --> 02:00:07.917
You only need to do one thing.

1179
02:00:09.417 --> 02:00:11.875
Abandon your mystical powers.

1180
02:00:11.958 --> 02:00:13.667
I can help you.

1181
02:00:13.750 --> 02:00:15.917
I know someone in Trenggalek

1182
02:00:16.000 --> 02:00:18.708
who can help you. and he can heal you.

1183
02:00:18.792 --> 02:00:19.875
It's not that easy.

1184
02:00:19.958 --> 02:00:22.000
It all depends on your intentions.
Suzzanna.

1185
02:00:26.667 --> 02:00:29.375
But will Allah forgive my sins?

1186
02:00:30.792 --> 02:00:32.333
Allah is Most Forgiving.

1187
02:00:35.000 --> 02:00:37.083
You just have to believe.

1188
02:00:43.375 --> 02:00:44.542
Thank you.

1189
02:00:48.000 --> 02:00:49.750
For always helping me.

1190
02:00:52.167 --> 02:00:55.042
Not just once. but twice.

1191
02:00:56.708 --> 02:00:57.917
Three times.

1192
02:00:58.667 --> 02:01:00.208
You forgot the motorbike.

1193
02:01:05.500 --> 02:01:06.500
Alright then.

1194
02:01:09.250 --> 02:01:12.792
I've been looking around for you.
Turns out you're here.

1195
02:01:12.875 --> 02:01:14.500
What is it?

1196
02:01:14.583 --> 02:01:17.167
Earlier the police came to the office

1197
02:01:17.250 --> 02:01:19.542
- with a letter for you. Pramuja.
- Yes.

1198
02:01:19.625 --> 02:01:23.625
They said this was found
in the living room of Bisman's house.

1199
02:01:24.375 --> 02:01:25.667
For me?

1200
02:01:25.750 --> 02:01:27.292
Yes.

1201
02:01:27.375 --> 02:01:29.833
Carry on then.

1202
02:01:29.917 --> 02:01:31.625
Hope you get married. Ow!

1203
02:01:32.250 --> 02:01:33.500
Get married soon.

1204
02:01:36.792 --> 02:01:37.792
Gosh.

1205
02:01:41.083 --> 02:01:42.083
Did your father…

1206
02:01:42.958 --> 02:01:44.625
Know Bisman?

1207
02:01:44.708 --> 02:01:47.042
Bisman once told me that

1208
02:01:48.250 --> 02:01:49.958
he knew my father.

1209
02:01:57.875 --> 02:01:58.958
It's my mother's picture.

1210
02:01:59.583 --> 02:02:01.667
Why did Bisman have
a photo of your mother?

1211
02:02:13.583 --> 02:02:14.750
<i>Pramuja.</i>

1212
02:02:15.417 --> 02:02:20.250
<i>This is the first time I've felt
what happiness is like.</i>

1213
02:02:20.333 --> 02:02:22.083
<i>That is after knowing</i>

1214
02:02:22.167 --> 02:02:25.667
<i>that I have a very good son.</i>

1215
02:02:25.750 --> 02:02:27.750
<i>So unlike his father.</i>

1216
02:02:27.833 --> 02:02:30.667
<i>You can be embarrassed
to have a father like me.</i>

1217
02:02:30.750 --> 02:02:32.833
<i>But I am proud to have a son like you.</i>

1218
02:02:36.500 --> 02:02:42.875
It is called the bamboo-bundle spell.
Its power is equal to the death-hex.

1219
02:02:42.958 --> 02:02:47.625
but it won't strike only Bisman.

1220
02:02:47.708 --> 02:02:51.458
<i>All of his descendants
will perish as well.</i>

1221
02:02:53.917 --> 02:02:55.542
<i>If you try to undo it.</i>

1222
02:02:55.625 --> 02:02:59.792
<i>its destructive power will return
to hit the sender.</i>

1223
02:02:59.875 --> 02:03:02.417
<i>To hit you.</i>

1224
02:03:02.500 --> 02:03:06.375
<i>I'm sorry I couldn't be
a good father to you.</i>

1225
02:03:06.458 --> 02:03:10.750
<i>Even though it's impossible
to erase the mistakes I've made.</i>

1226
02:03:10.833 --> 02:03:15.042
<i>I have decided
to leave all of my wealth to you.</i>

1227
02:03:15.125 --> 02:03:20.708
<i>I hope you can find it in your heart
to forgive me.</i>

1228
02:03:48.250 --> 02:03:49.417
Suzzanna.

1229
02:03:50.708 --> 02:03:51.833
Suzzanna?

1230
02:04:04.792 --> 02:04:05.917
Suzzanna?

1231
02:04:26.292 --> 02:04:27.292
Suzzanna!

1232
02:04:29.208 --> 02:04:32.042
Suzzanna! Open up!
What's wrong with you? Open the door!

1233
02:04:33.458 --> 02:04:37.375
Let me bear all the consequences
of my actions. Pramuja.

1234
02:04:38.083 --> 02:04:42.250
I cast the witchcraft not only to Bisman.

1235
02:04:43.875 --> 02:04:48.417
but also. to all his descendants.

1236
02:04:49.000 --> 02:04:50.458
Oh. God.

1237
02:04:51.250 --> 02:04:54.167
You won't end up like Bisman

1238
02:04:56.958 --> 02:04:59.375
because I've already cancelled the attack.

1239
02:05:01.875 --> 02:05:03.833
It will hit me back.

1240
02:05:04.500 --> 02:05:06.667
No. don't. Don't do this.
No. Suzzanna. Don't do this.

1241
02:05:06.750 --> 02:05:08.417
There must be another way.

1242
02:05:08.500 --> 02:05:10.958
You can cancel all of this by repenting.

1243
02:05:11.542 --> 02:05:13.458
It's not that easy. Pramuja.

1244
02:05:16.917 --> 02:05:18.667
I've gone too far

1245
02:05:19.875 --> 02:05:21.542
down the wrong path.

1246
02:05:21.625 --> 02:05:25.708
The unforgiving path of polytheism.

1247
02:05:26.417 --> 02:05:28.000
Full of sin.

1248
02:05:28.083 --> 02:05:30.625
Forgiveness belongs to Allah.

1249
02:05:30.708 --> 02:05:32.750
It's not up to us to decide.

1250
02:05:32.833 --> 02:05:35.333
I beg you to ask forgiveness from Allah.

1251
02:05:35.417 --> 02:05:37.917
Ask Allah for help
while you still have the chance.

1252
02:05:39.208 --> 02:05:43.125
The doors of heaven are no longer open
for me. Pramuja.

1253
02:05:46.500 --> 02:05:49.750
The doors of heaven are locked for me.

1254
02:06:02.333 --> 02:06:04.042
But I'm happy.

1255
02:06:09.667 --> 02:06:14.250
Seeing Karang Setan free from oppression.

1256
02:06:19.417 --> 02:06:21.958
Like my father's wish.

1257
02:06:31.208 --> 02:06:33.417
Every change

1258
02:06:33.500 --> 02:06:36.667
requires sacrifice.

1259
02:06:38.917 --> 02:06:41.500
Suzzanna. don't. Suzzanna!

1260
02:06:41.583 --> 02:06:42.792
Suzzanna?

1261
02:06:47.958 --> 02:06:49.000
Suzzanna?

1262
02:06:50.125 --> 02:06:51.500
Suzzanna?

1263
02:07:52.708 --> 02:07:53.917
Oh…

1264
02:07:54.000 --> 02:07:55.500
Oh. God…

1265
02:07:55.583 --> 02:07:59.000
Oh. God. please forgive her.

1266
02:08:19.625 --> 02:08:21.375
<i>Ladies and Gentlemen.</i>

1267
02:08:21.458 --> 02:08:24.375
<i>respected residents of Karang Setan.</i>

1268
02:08:24.458 --> 02:08:27.583
<i>There are several things
I would like to convey to you.</i>

1269
02:08:28.458 --> 02:08:30.417
<i>I. Pramuja.</i>

1270
02:08:31.542 --> 02:08:33.292
am the son of Boss…

1271
02:08:36.708 --> 02:08:38.458
I am the son of Bisman.

1272
02:08:39.208 --> 02:08:42.458
Therefore. I inherited his wealth.

1273
02:08:43.958 --> 02:08:46.125
The wealth that he had obtained so far

1274
02:08:46.958 --> 02:08:50.042
in ways that defy religious rules.

1275
02:08:50.125 --> 02:08:51.750
and violate state regulations.

1276
02:08:52.333 --> 02:08:54.625
I will return them completely

1277
02:08:54.708 --> 02:08:56.149
to all of you. ladies and gentlemen.

1278
02:08:56.708 --> 02:08:58.208
Oh. thank God.

1279
02:08:58.292 --> 02:09:00.667
All of your debt to Bisman

1280
02:09:01.333 --> 02:09:03.750
will be considered paid.

1281
02:09:03.833 --> 02:09:05.208
Thank God.

1282
02:09:05.750 --> 02:09:10.625
<i>The rice fields that were forcibly seized.
from all of you</i>

1283
02:09:10.708 --> 02:09:13.208
<i>shall be returned to you completely.</i>

1284
02:09:13.292 --> 02:09:15.875
KARANG NIRWONO MARKET - BANYUWANGI

1285
02:09:29.625 --> 02:09:32.000
KARANG NIRWONO VILLAGE HEAD OFFICE

1286
02:09:59.250 --> 02:10:02.792
SUZZANNA DAUGHTER OF SATRIYO
